#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-settings.php:1344
msgid ""
"<strong>How to configure it:</strong><br>1. Create any secret string (e.g.: "
"<code>my_ig_token_2024</code>) and type it here.<br>2. Save the settings.<br>"
"3. When configuring the webhook on Meta, use exactly the same string as the "
"&laquo;Verify Token&raquo;."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Com configurar-ho:</strong><br> 1. Crea qualsevol cadena secreta "
"(per exemple: <code>my_ig_token_2024</code> ) i escriu-la aquí.<br> 2. Desa "
"la configuració.<br> 3. Quan configureu el webhook a Meta, feu servir "
"exactament la mateixa cadena que el «Verify Token»."

#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-settings.php:1248
msgid ""
"<strong>How to configure it:</strong><br>1. Create any secret string (e.g.: "
"<code>my_secure_token_2024</code>) and type it here.<br>2. Save the settings."
"<br>3. When configuring the webhook on Meta (below), you will be asked for a "
"&laquo;Verify Token&raquo;: use exactly the same string.<br>Meta will send a "
"GET request with this token to verify that the webhook is yours."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Com configurar-ho:</strong><br> 1. Crea qualsevol cadena secreta "
"(per exemple: <code>my_secure_token_2024</code> ) i escriu-la aquí.<br> 2. "
"Desa la configuració.<br> 3. Quan configureu el webhook a Meta (a "
"continuació), se us demanarà un «Verify Token»: utilitzeu exactament la "
"mateixa cadena.<br> Meta enviarà una sol·licitud GET amb aquest token per "
"verificar que el webhook és vostre."

#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-settings.php:1355
msgid ""
"<strong>How to configure the webhook on Meta:</strong><br>1. Copy the URL "
"shown above.<br>2. Go to <a href=\"https://developers.facebook.com/apps/\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Meta for Developers</a> &gt; your app &gt; Instagram &gt; "
"Webhooks.<br>3. Paste the URL in the &laquo;Callback URL&raquo; field.<br>4. "
"In &laquo;Verify Token&raquo; type the same token you configured above.<br>5."
" Click &laquo;Verify and Save&raquo;.<br>6. Subscribe to the <code>"
"messages</code> webhook field."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Com configurar el webhook a Meta:</strong><br> 1. Copieu l&#39;URL "
"que es mostra a dalt.<br> 2. Ves a <a href=\"https://developers.facebook."
"com/apps/\" target=\"_blank\">Meta per a desenvolupadors</a> &gt; la teva "
"aplicació &gt; Instagram &gt; Webhooks.<br> 3. Enganxeu l&#39;URL al camp "
"«URL de devolució de trucada».<br> 4. A «Verifica el token», escriu el "
"mateix token que has configurat anteriorment.<br> 5. Feu clic a «Verifica i "
"desa».<br> 6. Subscriu-te al camp webhook <code>messages</code> ."

#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-settings.php:1259
msgid ""
"<strong>How to configure the webhook on Meta:</strong><br>1. Copy the URL "
"shown above.<br>2. Go to <a href=\"https://developers.facebook.com/apps/\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Meta for Developers</a> &gt; your app &gt; WhatsApp &gt; "
"Configuration.<br>3. In the &laquo;Webhook&raquo; section, click &laquo;"
"Edit&raquo;.<br>4. Paste the URL in the &laquo;Callback URL&raquo; field.<br>"
"5. In &laquo;Verify Token&raquo; type the same token you configured above."
"<br>6. Click &laquo;Verify and Save&raquo;.<br>7. In &laquo;Webhook "
"fields&raquo;, subscribe to the <code>messages</code> field."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Com configurar el webhook a Meta:</strong><br> 1. Copieu l&#39;URL "
"que es mostra a dalt.<br> 2. Ves a <a href=\"https://developers.facebook."
"com/apps/\" target=\"_blank\">Meta per a desenvolupadors</a> &gt; la teva "
"aplicació &gt; WhatsApp &gt; Configuració.<br> 3. A la secció «Webhook», feu "
"clic a «Edita».<br> 4. Enganxeu l&#39;URL al camp «URL de devolució de "
"trucada».<br> 5. A «Verifica el token», escriu el mateix token que has "
"configurat anteriorment.<br> 6. Feu clic a «Verifica i desa».<br> 7. A "
"«Camps del Webhook», subscriviu-vos al camp <code>messages</code> ."

#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-settings.php:1230
msgid ""
"<strong>How to get it (temporary token):</strong><br>1. Go to <a "
"href=\"https://developers.facebook.com/apps/\" target=\"_blank\">Meta for "
"Developers</a> &gt; your app &gt; WhatsApp &gt; API Setup.<br>2. In the "
"&laquo;Temporary access token&raquo; section, click <strong>Generate</strong>"
" and copy the token. <em>Expires in ~24 hours.</em><br><br><strong>Permanent "
"token (recommended for production):</strong><br>1. Go to <a href=\"https:"
"//business.facebook.com/settings/\" target=\"_blank\">Meta Business Suite</a>"
" &gt; Settings &gt; Business settings.<br>2. Under <strong>Users &gt; System "
"Users</strong>, create a System User of type <em>Admin</em>.<br>3. Assign "
"the WhatsApp App asset to it.<br>4. Generate a token with the <code>"
"whatsapp_business_messaging</code> permission.<br>5. This token does not "
"expire and does not need renewal."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Com aconseguir-ho (token temporal):</strong><br> 1. Ves a <a "
"href=\"https://developers.facebook.com/apps/\" target=\"_blank\">Meta per a "
"desenvolupadors</a> &gt; la teva aplicació &gt; WhatsApp &gt; Configuració "
"de l&#39;API.<br> 2. A la secció «Token d&#39;accés temporal», feu clic a "
"<strong>Genera</strong> i copieu el token. <em>Caduca en unes 24 hores.</em>"
"<br><br> <strong>Token permanent (recomanat per a producció):</strong><br> 1."
" Aneu a <a href=\"https://business.facebook.com/settings/\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Meta Business Suite</a> &gt; Configuració &gt; "
"Configuració empresarial.<br> 2. A <strong>Usuaris &gt; Usuaris del "
"sistema</strong> , creeu un usuari del sistema de tipus <em>"
"Administrador</em> .<br> 3. Assigneu-hi l&#39;actiu de l&#39;aplicació "
"WhatsApp.<br> 4. Genera un token amb el permís <code>"
"whatsapp_business_messaging</code> .<br> 5. Aquest token no caduca i no cal "
"renovar-lo."

#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-settings.php:1153
msgid ""
"<strong>How to get it:</strong><br>1. Go to <a href=\"https://dashscope."
"console.aliyun.com/apiKey\" target=\"_blank\">DashScope Console</a>.<br>2. "
