#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-settings.php:1326
msgid ""
"<strong>How to get it:</strong><br>1. Go to <a href=\"https://developers."
"facebook.com/apps/\" target=\"_blank\">Meta for Developers</a> &gt; your app "
"&gt; Instagram &gt; API Setup.<br>2. Generate an access token with <code>"
"instagram_manage_messages</code> permission.<br><br><strong>Permanent token "
"(recommended):</strong><br>Use a System User token from <a href=\"https:"
"//business.facebook.com/settings/\" target=\"_blank\">Meta Business Suite</a>"
" with <code>instagram_manage_messages</code> permission."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Com aconseguir-ho:</strong><br> 1. Ves a <a href=\"https:"
"//developers.facebook.com/apps/\" target=\"_blank\">Meta per a "
"desenvolupadors</a> &gt; la teva aplicació &gt; Instagram &gt; Configuració "
"de l&#39;API.<br> 2. Genera un token d&#39;accés amb permís <code>"
"instagram_manage_messages</code> .<br><br> <strong>Token permanent "
"(recomanat):</strong><br> Utilitzeu un token d&#39;usuari del sistema de <a "
"href=\"https://business.facebook.com/settings/\" target=\"_blank\">Meta "
"Business Suite</a> amb permís <code>instagram_manage_messages</code> ."

#: includes/class-pn-customers-manager-settings.php:1239
msgid ""
"<strong>How to get it:</strong><br>1. Go to <a href=\"https://developers."
"facebook.com/apps/\" target=\"_blank\">Meta for Developers</a> &gt; your app "
"&gt; WhatsApp &gt; API Setup.<br>2. In the &laquo;From&raquo; section your "
"phone number appears with its <strong>Phone number ID</strong> below.<br>3. "
"Copy the numeric ID (e.g.: <code>123456789012345</code>) and paste it here."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Com aconseguir-ho:</strong><br> 1. Ves a <a href=\"https:"
"//developers.facebook.com/apps/\" target=\"_blank\">Meta per a "
"desenvolupadors</a> &gt; la teva aplicació &gt; WhatsApp &gt; Configuració "
"de l&#39;API.<br> 2. A la secció «De», apareixerà el vostre número de "
"telèfon amb el seu <strong>identificador</strong> a sota.<br> 3. Copieu "
"l&#39;ID numèric (per exemple: <code>123456789012345</code> ) i enganxeu-lo "
"aquí."

